16
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:09,739
Fraud Risk Score: 14.

17
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:10,920
Clean.

18
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:17,260
A fraudster can fake GPS. They cannot simultaneously fake
